{"diagnosis": "Loopback RX trapped with got 0xff vs want 0xa5, TX line stayed idle at ~0. Root cause is line 130: `send_divcnt > (cfg_divider >> 4)` shortens the TX bit period 16x (4 cycles vs 64 for divider 64). send_pattern/send_bitcnt shift too fast on ser_tx so the receiver samples only idle bits.", "patch_diff": "diff --git a/picosoc/simpleuart.v b/picosoc/simpleuart.v
--- a/picosoc/simpleuart.v
+++ b/picosoc/simpleuart.v
@@ -127,7 +127,7 @@
 				send_divcnt <= 0;
 			end else
-			if (send_divcnt > (cfg_divider >> 4) && send_bitcnt) begin
+			if (send_divcnt > cfg_divider && send_bitcnt) begin
 				send_pattern <= {1'b1, send_pattern[9:1]};
 				send_bitcnt <= send_bitcnt - 1;
 				send_divcnt <= 0;
", "expected": "tohost PASS (no TRAP), loopback got 0xa5 want 0xa5 with divider 64"}

